This rule describes the control loop of getting something done.

This rule urgently requests an agent to do all of the following:
1. Address the changes requested
2. Stage the changes with the git CLI
3. Confirm with the user to proceed, or return to step 1.
4. Create a diff summary [diff-summary.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/diff-summary.mdc) and write it to /tmp/commit.txt
5. Let the user review it and maybe save edits, allowing the user to click to continue
6. Read the final /tmp/commit.txt, commit, and push to origin